# Add this line to the session group of pam.d/sddm and of
# pam.d/sddm-autologin. Do not add it to pam.d/sddm-greeter.
# pam_exec runs it as root when the user session opens, and
# again when the session closes. SDDM runs no root script of
# its own between the greeter and the session. Xstop runs when
# the X server exits, which is logout, not this handoff.
session optional pam_exec.so @PREFIX@/bin/bhotkeys-greeter stop
